  "instructions": [
    "Preheat a wood-fired oven to 180°C.",
    "Combine desiccated coconut, rose petals, jasmine green tea, and maple syrup in a bowl.",
    "Heat coconut oil in a copper mug over medium heat.",
    "Add ghee and salt to the mug and stir.",
    "Pour the coconut mixture into the mug and stir to combine.",
    "Add fresh rose petals to the mug and stir.",
    "Transfer the mug to the preheated wood-fired oven and bake for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the mug from the oven and let it cool for 5 minutes.",
    "Garnish with lemon zest and serve warm."
  ],
